{"id":"vod_bf_45030","vodId":"45030","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"昭和元禄落语心中","name_cn":"昭和元禄落语心中","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-46/02b596a3ec8ad08364de1c90c7750b17.jpg"},"summary":"TV动画剧情发生在昭和元禄时代，主要描写了说书人（落语家）复杂的人际关系。孤高的大名人有乐亭八云、以及硬要拜其为师的与太郎、被誉为“绝代的名人”的八云的盟友助六的遗腹子——由八云抚养长大的小夏等充满个性的角色都会在本作中登场。 无法忘记在刑务所的落语慰问会中见到的大名人·八云的“死神”，出狱的与太郎径直前往寄席。拜倒在八云面前，成为他住所雇工以及弟子的与太郎，却发现在八云之处住着一位名叫小夏的女性。八云与小夏似乎有着他人无从触及的因缘……。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:13:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zhaoheyuanluluoyuxinzhong/第13集/index.